# Summary

This PR introduces a new Ignition SIM instance (`-b`) for both the DEV and QA environments. The new instance is configured to mirror the existing deployment while using its own environment-specific configuration and secrets.

## Changes Made

### 1. Added a new DEV overlay
- Created `overlays/dev-b` by duplicating the existing `overlays/dev` configuration.
- Updated the Kustomize overlay to deploy the new Ignition SIM instance.
- Modified resource names and labels where required to avoid conflicts with the existing instance.
- Updated the license and client secret references to use the new `-b` secrets.

### 2. Added a new QA overlay
- Created `overlays/qa-b` from the existing `overlays/qa` configuration.
- Applied the same configuration changes as the DEV overlay.
- Updated the environment-specific values required for the new QA instance.

### 3. Updated ArgoCD application configuration (DEV)
- Updated `argocd/apps/helios-apps`.
- Added a new ArgoCD Application definition for the `dev-b` overlay.
- Configured ArgoCD to deploy and manage the new Ignition SIM instance in the DEV environment.

### 4. Updated ArgoCD application configuration (QA)
- Updated `argocd/apps/helios-apps-qa`.
- Added a new ArgoCD Application definition for the `qa-b` overlay.
- Configured ArgoCD to deploy and manage the new Ignition SIM instance in the QA environment.

## Files/Directories Updated

- `overlays/dev-b/kustomization.yaml`
- `overlays/dev-b/secret-provider-class-license.yaml
